<h2 id="sec-research-summary" class="section-title">
  <span data-language="en" lang="en">🧭 Research Summary</span>
  <span data-language="zh" lang="zh-CN">🧭 研究总结</span>
</h2>
<div class="research-summary-section">
<div class="clearfix research-summary">
  <div data-language="en" lang="en">
    <p>I study the <strong>fundamental principles of post-training and alignment for generative models</strong>, with text-motion alignment and large-scale text-to-image post-training in industry as application settings.</p>
    <ol class="research-trajectory" aria-label="Main research trajectory">
    <li class="research-trajectory__item">
      <div class="research-trajectory__meta"><span>2024～2026</span></div>
    <p>At <strong>PALM@SEU</strong>, advised by Prof. <a href="https://cs.seu.edu.cn/hongsongwang/main.htm">Hongsong Wang</a> and collaborating with Prof. <a href="https://panzhous.github.io/">Pan Zhou</a> at <strong>SMU</strong>, I study text–motion alignment in motion generation: <a href="{{ '/projects/SoPo/index.html' | relative_url }}">SoPo</a> (NeurIPS 2025) addresses scarce preference pairs and sampling bias; <a href="https://wengwanjiang.github.io/ReAlign-page/">ReAlign</a> (AAAI 2026) aligns pretrained generators without fine-tuning; and <a href="{{ '/projects/EasyTune/index.html' | relative_url }}">EasyTune</a> (ICLR 2026) improves alignment with substantially less memory. Building on this, <a href="{{ '/projects/MotionRFT/index.html' | relative_url }}">MotionRFT</a> (IEEE TPAMI 2026) extends post-training across motion representations, improving HY Motion’s FID by 23.3%.</p>
    </li>
    <li class="research-trajectory__item">
      <div class="research-trajectory__meta"><span>2025～2026</span></div>
    <p>At <strong>Tencent YouTu</strong>, I worked with <a href="https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=JIKuf4AAAAAJ">Jun Liu</a>, <a href="https://csgaobb.github.io/">Bin-Bin Gao</a>, and <a href="https://retofan233.github.io/">Yuanting Fan</a> at Tencent, and Prof. <a href="https://www.sustech.edu.cn/en/faculties/zhengfeng.html">Feng Zheng</a> and <a href="https://jam-cc.github.io/">Xi Jiang</a> at <strong>SUSTech</strong>, on image-generation post-training and underexplored barriers to deployment: <a href="{{ '/projects/ConsistentRFT/index.html' | relative_url }}">DPGO</a> (under review) reduces low- and high-level perceptual hallucinations by 49% and 38% on average, respectively; <a href="{{ '/projects/PEC/index.html' | relative_url }}">PEC</a> (NeurIPS 2026, <strong>Spotlight</strong>) mitigates diversity collapse, raising the evaluated quality–diversity score from 0.366 to 0.734.</p>
    </li>
    <li class="research-trajectory__item">
      <div class="research-trajectory__meta"><span>2026～Present</span></div>
    <p>At <strong>Tencent HY</strong>, I study the reliability of reward supervision and learning progression, collaborating with Prof. <a href="https://faculty.ucmerced.edu/mhyang/">Ming-Hsuan Yang</a> as a remote visiting student at <strong>UC Merced</strong>. Our <a href="{{ '/projects/spatialcritic/' | relative_url }}">SpatialCritic</a> (under review) addresses these challenges in spatial generation, achieving 95.08% spatial-preference verification accuracy on our SpaRW-Eval benchmark.</p>
    </li>
    </ol>
    <div class="research-foundations">
      <div class="research-foundations__label">2022～2024</div>
    <p>My earlier anomaly-detection work includes <a href="{{ '/Publications/' | relative_url }}#tanGB">MGBOD</a> (IEEE TKDE 2025) with Prof. <a href="https://csse.szu.edu.cn/pages/user/index?id=953">Can Gao</a> at <strong>SZU</strong>, and <a href="{{ '/projects/FG-Diff/index.html' | relative_url }}">FG-Diff</a> (IEEE TIP 2026) for video anomaly detection with Prof. <a href="https://cs.seu.edu.cn/hongsongwang/main.htm">Hongsong Wang</a> at <strong>PALM@SEU</strong>.</p>
    </div>
    <p class="research-outlook"><strong>Looking ahead, I hope to explore video generation, world models, and embodied intelligence, with an emphasis on physical consistency, while further investigating the fundamental principles of generative models.</strong></p>
  </div>
  <div data-language="zh" lang="zh-CN">
    <p>我研究<strong>生成模型后训练与对齐的基础原理</strong>，以文本与动作对齐，以及工业界大规模文生图模型的后训练为应用场景。</p>
    <ol class="research-trajectory" aria-label="主要研究脉络">
    <li class="research-trajectory__item">
      <div class="research-trajectory__meta"><span>2024～2026</span></div>
    <p>在 <strong>PALM@SEU</strong>，我在 <a href="https://cs.seu.edu.cn/hongsongwang/main.htm">Hongsong Wang（王洪松）</a>教授指导下，并与 <strong>SMU</strong> 的 <a href="https://panzhous.github.io/">Pan Zhou（周攀）</a>教授合作，研究动作生成中的文本与动作对齐：<a href="{{ '/projects/SoPo/index.html' | relative_url }}">SoPo</a>（NeurIPS 2025）应对偏好对稀缺与采样偏差；<a href="https://wengwanjiang.github.io/ReAlign-page/">ReAlign</a>（AAAI 2026）无需微调即可对齐预训练生成模型；<a href="{{ '/projects/EasyTune/index.html' | relative_url }}">EasyTune</a>（ICLR 2026）在提升对齐效果的同时大幅降低显存开销。在此基础上，<a href="{{ '/projects/MotionRFT/index.html' | relative_url }}">MotionRFT</a>（IEEE TPAMI 2026）将后训练拓展至不同动作表示，使 HY Motion 的 FID 改善 23.3%。</p>
    </li>
    <li class="research-trajectory__item">
      <div class="research-trajectory__meta"><span>2025～2026</span></div>
    <p>在 <strong>Tencent YouTu</strong>，我与腾讯的 <a href="https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=JIKuf4AAAAAJ">Jun Liu</a>、<a href="https://csgaobb.github.io/">Bin-Bin Gao</a>、<a href="https://retofan233.github.io/">Yuanting Fan</a>，以及<strong>南方科技大学</strong>的 <a href="https://www.sustech.edu.cn/en/faculties/zhengfeng.html">Feng Zheng</a> 教授、<a href="https://jam-cc.github.io/">Xi Jiang</a> 合作，研究图像生成后训练中较少受到关注的落地障碍：<a href="{{ '/projects/ConsistentRFT/index.html' | relative_url }}">DPGO</a>（在投）使低层、高层感知幻觉分别平均减少 49%、38%；<a href="{{ '/projects/PEC/index.html' | relative_url }}">PEC</a>（NeurIPS 2026，<strong>Spotlight</strong>）缓解多样性崩溃，将所评测的质量与多样性综合得分从 0.366 提升至 0.734。</p>
    </li>
    <li class="research-trajectory__item">
      <div class="research-trajectory__meta"><span>2026～现在</span></div>
    <p>在 <strong>Tencent HY</strong>，我进一步研究奖励监督的可靠性与学习进程，并以远程访问学生身份与 <strong>UC Merced</strong> 的 <a href="https://faculty.ucmerced.edu/mhyang/">Ming-Hsuan Yang</a> 教授合作。我们提出的 <a href="{{ '/projects/spatialcritic/' | relative_url }}">SpatialCritic</a>（在投）针对空间生成中的这些问题，在我们构建的空间偏好评测基准 SpaRW-Eval 上实现 95.08% 的验证准确率。</p>
    </li>
    </ol>
    <div class="research-foundations">
      <div class="research-foundations__label">2022～2024</div>
    <p>我的早期异常检测工作包括在 <strong>SZU</strong> 与 <a href="https://csse.szu.edu.cn/pages/user/index?id=953">Can Gao</a> 教授开展的 <a href="{{ '/Publications/' | relative_url }}#tanGB">MGBOD</a>（IEEE TKDE 2025），以及在 <strong>PALM@SEU</strong> 与 <a href="https://cs.seu.edu.cn/hongsongwang/main.htm">Hongsong Wang（王洪松）</a>教授开展的视频异常检测工作 <a href="{{ '/projects/FG-Diff/index.html' | relative_url }}">FG-Diff</a>（IEEE TIP 2026）。</p>
    </div>
    <p class="research-outlook"><strong>下一步，我希望探索视频生成、世界模型与具身智能，重点关注物理一致性，同时进一步探究生成模型的基础原理。</strong></p>
  </div>
</div>
</div>
